  "created": 1780595985669,
  "description": "his automation is triggered when a work item is moved into the Solve Hub (SOLVE) space from another space. When the work item has a Request Type of Issue or an Issue Type of Solve Ticket, the automation updates the Post Creation Automation Status field to \"Moved to SOLVE\". This field update acts as a trigger for the SOLVE: Ticket Creation Initializer Listener, which performs the post-conversion initialization activities required to configure the work item as a SOLVE ticket, including populating default values, establishing required relationships, and preparing the ticket for SOLVE-specific processing.",
